      },
      "message": "fix(2d): refuse a side whose slope turns back at half depth\n\nThe drafted-wall test compared unsigned distances, so a side that\nbends back half way down read as a straight draft. Check that the\nhalf-depth section passes through the point half way between the top\nedge and its foot on the wall.\n\nRefs #2929\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
